name  Ski Jump
hint  Jump the chasm. The cup will wait for you.
ink    800
target 305
par    6
hold   3

emitter 140 90   0 1   380 650 36

# left bank
chain 6   40 560   430 560   430 720
# the chasm
nodraw 440 60  250 660
drain  430 640  250 80

# the cup. It does not, in fact, wait: it bolts once water crosses the chasm.
shift 220 0  0.8   690 60 120 660
  chain 6   740 470   740 660   900 660   900 470
  goal      747 490   146 164
end

solution 100 200  130 260  330 480  425 400
solution 700 420  975 475
